[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="HelpPageDef" load_steps=2 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://sim/data/help_page_def.gd" id="1"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1")
id = "controls"
order = 10
title = "Controls"
body = "Mouse
Left click: place a building or select one.
Right click (let go without dragging): cancel the tool or deselect.
Right drag, middle drag or W A S D: move the view.
Mouse wheel: zoom.

Time
Space: pause.
1, 2, 3: speed.

Building
The command grid (bottom-right) opens a category; in a pane Q W E R T / A S D F G / Z X C V pick its cells, B shows More and Esc goes back.
R: road (also opens the Roads pane).
C: channel (from the Village era).
{channel_help}
P: paved road (from the Town era).
J: rail track (from the Conflux era).
X: demolish.
U: upgrade mode: click buildings to upgrade them.
Z: clear: click-drag forest, stumps and rock to have builders clear them (wood and stone to storage). Click again or X unmarks. Cleared rock is no longer a quarry spot.
Y: plant: click-drag grass to mark it; Foresters in reach plant marked tiles before any other grass. Click again or X unmarks.
N, F, W, I, K, S, D, A, O: open housing, food, water, Lumen, logistics, resources, refining, civic and landmark.

Views
V: blight.
G: roads.
T: water.
H: coverage.
L: Lumen grid.
M: region map.
Tab: switch between ground and sky.

Menus
Esc: cancel the tool or selection; if there is none, the pause menu.
F1: this help."
keys = PackedStringArray("SPACE", "1", "2", "3", "R", "C", "P", "J", "X", "U", "Z", "Y", "N", "F", "W", "I", "K", "S", "D", "A", "O", "Q", "E", "T", "M", "V", "G", "H", "L", "TAB", "ESCAPE", "F1")
